{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02582","headline":"门有车马客 · 虞世南","name":"门有车马客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陈遵重交结，田蚡擅豪华。\n曲台临上路，高轩抵狭斜。\n赭汗千金马，绣轴五香车。\n白鹤随飞盖，朱鹭入鸣笳。\n夏莲开劒水，春桃发绶花。\n高谈辩飞兔，摛藻握灵蛇。\n逢恩出毛羽，失路委泥沙。\n暧暧风烟晚，路长归骑远。\n日斜青琐第，尘飞金谷苑。\n危弦促柱奏巴渝，遗簪堕珥解罗襦。\n如何守直道，翻使谷名愚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}